# TarpSlice CLI

A simple, production-style Python CLI tool that converts one image into a tiled multi-page PDF for tarpapel/poster printing.

## Features
- Image input (PNG, JPG, JPEG, BMP, WEBP)
- Standard paper sizes (A4, Letter, Legal, Long Bond)
- Portrait or landscape page orientation
- Rows × columns tiling mode
- Optional overlap between pages
- Cut/crop guides on every page
- Page labels for assembly (example: `Row 1, Col 2`)
- Clean, modular project structure

## Quick start
```bash
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
pip install -e .
python -m tarpslice
```

## Notes
- Print the resulting PDF at **100% scale / actual size**.
- This MVP currently supports **image input only**.
